  "scope": "Simplify reversed-order proof in ObjectResidualSquares.square_gap",
  "validation": "Paired target and three tracked direct module clients pass; all three client object pairs match. The focused ObjectResidualSquares check passes with source and target pins. Four target direct project providers match current-source producer receipts. Target namespace/type/axiom and global simp/instance reports match.",
  "limitations": [
    "The umbrella DiophantineConsistency.lean directly imports this module but was not rebuilt.",
    "QuadraticRegisterComposition 91ce83…, GatesSemiring df89e8… and QuarticSemiring 2a1a9a… are client direct cached object inputs without matched current-source producer receipts. ObjectNaturalDiscrete also uses cached BoundedZFCConsistency InternalSat and CodedDerivation objects.",
    "Wider project and package transitive closure remains cached; no full current-source closure is claimed. Matching census and client object reports do not establish every persistent environment extension or umbrella behavior.",
    "The cold object-model exploratory probe was interrupted without a full timing/input receipt, and the later generic probe also lacks full pins; paired builds supply validation. A single shared-load timing pair is not a general benchmark.",
    "Author records are historical; the independent review/audit verify commit and parent. Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted; external objects are needed to independently verify recorded object hashes."
  ],
